  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Product Details**\n\nI\'m starting to visualize a Product Detail component, specifically a modal, for custom orders and WhatsApp integration. I\'ve decided on the filename `/src/components/ProductDetailsModal.tsx`. My current focus is designing the presentation of the modal, I\'m thinking of displaying a large product photo for starters.\n\n\n**Detailing Product Options**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the Product Details Modal\'s content. I\'m focusing on the product presentation: name with badges, detailed description, and clear pricing. I\'m actively working on interactive configuration options like scent selection (dynamic from `product.scents`), color/aspect selection (with standard and custom options), and quantity selection. I\'m also including a customization details field and refining the pickup/delivery options, including shipping estimates and disclaimers. I\'m building a manufacturing warning and shipping disclaimers too.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now build the `/src/components/ProductDetailsModal.tsx` component. It implements the customized artisanal checkout experience described in section 6. Under this flow, customers choose scents, organic raw beeswax/soy wax colors, quantities, custom label messages or events, and pick a shipping or local workshop pick-up mode. Finally, they generate the custom WhatsApp text template exactly as requested by section 6 to text M\303\251lanie & Christelle."
