    thinking: "**Defining the new feature**\n\nI\'ve got the product list and component design beautifully mapped out! Now, I\'m focusing on defining the new `personnalisation` tab. It requires a route and specific content: a hero section with the title \"Cr\303\251ez une composition parfum\303\251e \303\240\".\n\n\n**Outlining the content**\n\nI\'m now outlining the specific content for the \"personnalisation\" tab. I\'m structuring a compelling narrative! I am mapping out a hero section, and a clear call to action, and I\'m designing sections that will explain customizable elements and provide a visual of the 4-step process. I\'m also including some examples to give some ideas on how to use this feature! Finally, I\'ve got the form to capture customization requests ready.\n\n\n**Structuring the content**\n\nI am now structuring the content for the `\303\200 propos` and `Contact` tabs. I\'m focusing on crafting a compelling hero section for each. I\'m developing the \"\303\200 propos\" content with a compelling narrative about the founders and the brand\'s values, including sections on the workshop\'s history, the fabrication process, and a card display highlighting values. The `Contact` tab is organized around answering inquiries through the hero section and providing cards for quick contact.\n\n\n**Organizing the contact options**\n\nI\'m currently organizing the various contact methods. I\'m structuring a predefined WhatsApp string for specific inquiries like \"Commander un produit\" and \"Demander une personnalisation.\" I\'m also planning a general contact form, gathering name, phone, subject, and message, also routed to WhatsApp. I\'m defining practical information like geographical zones, home pickup, and response times. Finally, I\'m listing out the legal pages in the footer. I am also planning on building these as modular components!\n\n\n**Implementing the modular structure**\n\nI\'m now implementing the modular structure as requested to prevent large, unwieldy files. Specifically, I\'m creating dedicated files for `CustomizationPage.tsx`, `AboutPage.tsx`, `ContactPage.tsx`, and `LegalPages.tsx`, which will contain all legal views. I am also reviewing existing files, such as `src/components/Header.tsx`, to integrate and ensure proper import structures.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create the Customization page in a new React component `/src/components/CustomizationPage.tsx`. It will describe what can be customized, explain the 4-step artisan process, showcase use cases, and feature an interactive custom form that builds and triggers the WhatsApp communication string. Let\'s create this file."
