ts.\n\n\n**Reviewing New Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on a section detailing a product\'s composition and origin. I\'m focusing on two key aspects: the composition\'s \"saine et responsable\" attributes, using \"cire v\303\251g\303\251tale de soja biod\303\251gradable\" without petroleum derivatives, and the \"Atelier Fran\303\247ais Fait Main\" aspect. I\'m observing the formatting of the details in a `div` element, specifically, a bulleted list with bolded headers, and associated text.\n\n\n**Isolating Component Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on a `div` element with a glowing ring background. I am now noting several classes: `bg-brand-purple/5`, `filter blur-3xl`, `pointer-events-none` and `rounded-full`. Inside, I can see a product detail\'s visual. I can also see a `Droplet` component, and several text elements. Next, I\'ll examine the classes used for the inner content.\n\n\n\n**Analyzing New Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on two new elements. First, I see a section in a grid format with two columns that contains two distinct arguments for the product. I\'m focusing on the styling applied to each of them. I\'ve noted a class that describes a change on hover. I see the 03 argument is \"Enti\303\250rement Personnalisable\" and I\'m noting the class styling it. I am also reviewing the second section within the grid, which presents a separate argument.\n\n\n\n**Reviewing Final Sections**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the final section within the grid, specifically focusing on the use of a circular indicator with a number (\"04\") and its hover state. I\'m noting the classes used for the circular background, the text color, and the transition effect, including the use of an inline-flex element. I\'m taking a close look at the title, the paragraph text description, and the component used, along with the transition effect. Finally, I\'ll examine the ScentQuiz component that follows.\n\n\n**Examining Collaboration Content**\n\nI\'m now diving into the partnership summary