    modified_response: "I have successfully designed and built the fully responsive, immersive experience for **R\303\252ve Parfum\303\251 Cr\303\251ation**, meticulously aligning the layout with all design specifications.\n\nHere is a summary of the achievements completed:\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Visual Identity & Premium Experience\n*   **Cosmic Warm Atmosphere**: Implemented an elegant ambient dark design with decorative glowing radial light globes in the background and premium glassmorphism classes (`.liquid-soft`, `.liquid-strong`) that replicate a warm fragrance workshop.\n*   **Typography Pairings**: Paired high-contrast display headings with luxurious, organic serif families to reflect craftsmanship, offset by crisp monospaced fonts for technical weights and details.\n*   **Floating Navigation Header**: Created a floating upper navigation capsule with quick responsive access to the catalog, customization pages, and WhatsApp checkouts.\n\n### \360\237\215\203 Boutique Catalog & Advanced Scent Selection\n*   **Category-Based Floating Cards**: Built prominent category cards featuring hover transformations and status identifiers for *Bouquets parfum\303\251s*, *Fondants*, *Bougies*, and *Cadres parfum\303\251s*.\n*   **Premium Interactive Filters**: Added real-time user state filters to find creations by maximum price (adjustable slider), target occasion (e.g., weddings, gifts, home aroma), customizability toggles, and olfactive notes.\n*   **Scent Finder Quiz Wizard**: Integrated an interactive scent discovery layout supporting dynamic outcome generation, suggesting products on the spot according to choice profiles (florals, sweet, gourmands, aromatic).\n\n### \360\237\222\254 Seamless Checkout & Artisanal Pillars\n*   **Dual CTAs & Product Showcases**: Provided rich action panels with dual calls-to-action to either instantly check out or directly query the craft artist with single-click actions.\n*   **Artisanal Rassurance Grid**: Laid out a central Caf\303\251-styled section detailing natural soy wax commitments, Grasse aromas (zero CMR, zero phthalate), custom designs, and gift tradition arguments.\n*   **Social & Booking Systems**: Enabled structured quote simulators for major celebrations and home host bookings, supplemented by reviews imported from online customer chats."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
