y improving their presentation. I\'m adding a HandHeart icon next to \"Fait main\" and a Calendar icon next to \"Pr\303\251commande\" to enhance visual distinction. I am considering ways to improve the surrounding layout of these sections to make the information stand out more clearly, and I\'ll keep refining the formatting.\n\n\n**Revising Shipping Details**\n\nI\'m now revising the shipping details section, replacing the original text block with a concise alternative. I\'m focusing on clarifying \"Les frais d\'envoi,\" keeping the information about shipping costs and options clear. I\'ll make the messaging more concise, and also refine the italicized \"Envois\" section to improve readability for the user.\n\n\n**Updating Visual Cues**\n\nI\'m now changing the shipping details to make them more impactful. I\'ve added a Truck icon for \"Exp\303\251ditions & Acheminements.\" I\'m refining the \"Les frais d\'envoi\" message to improve readability, along with revising the italicized \"Envois\" section for greater clarity. Also, I\'m replacing the emoji from line 180, \360\237\214\270, with its semantic alternative, and I will be reviewing and refactoring the scent selection button.\n\n\n**Refactoring Component Elements**\n\nI\'m now refactoring the scent selection button\'s styling to improve visual clarity and consistency. The changes focus on refining its visual cues. I\'m focusing on the component\'s structure in order to streamline the user interface. Also, I\'m refactoring the delivery options, specifically lines 217-229, to improve user experience.\n\n\n**Revising Delivery Options**\n\nI\'m now revising the delivery mode buttons. The goal is to visually distinguish the options and enhance usability. I\'ve updated the styles for the \"Retrait Atelier\" button. I\'m focusing on lines 225-228, specifically refining the appearance of the button when selected. I\'ll test these updates and adjust the formatting.\n\n\n**Improving Button Usability**\n\nI\'m now refining 