  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Approach to UI**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI elements. Specifically, in `src/App.tsx`, I\'m figuring out how to pass callbacks like `onNavigateToBoutique` and `onNavigateToContact` and adjust lines, but first, I\'m examining `AboutPage.tsx`, aiming for a custom, premium, warm, poetic design, but absolutely NOT generic.\n\n\n**Crafting About Page Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of `AboutPage.tsx`. I\'m starting to translate the desired structure into code. I\'m focusing on the `Badge`, `Title`, `Subtitle`, and the visual elements first. Then, I\'ll tackle the \"Histoire de la marque\" section with its text and images, and finally, the presentation of M\303\251lanie and Christelle with portrait cards. I\'m keen on a warm and artisanal feel.\n\n\n**Developing Atelier Content**\n\nI\'m now outlining the \"Fabrication,\" \"Valeurs,\" and \"Galerie d\'atelier\" sections. The fabrication segment will detail the candle-making process in four steps, highlighting materials like soy wax and Grasse perfumes, with a focus on custom finishes. The \"Valeurs\" section will be a grid of six cards: Naturel, Fait main, Soin du d\303\251tail, Personnalisation, Senteurs durables, and Cadeau \303\251motionnel. Finally, I\'m planning an asymmetric gallery with elegant captions for the \"Galerie d\'atelier.\" I also plan to re-examine existing code in `AboutPage.tsx`.\n\n\n**Overhauling About Page**\n\nI\'m now fully committed to a complete rewrite of `AboutPage.tsx`. My focus is on achieving a premium aesthetic, strictly adhering to the prompt\'s requirements. This involves leveraging Framer Motion for animations, creating a gorgeous layout, designing custom cards, and implementing an elegant four-step fabrication process. I\'m also planning an elegant workshop gallery and a high-converting call to action. I\'ll be using `create_file` with `Overwrite: true` for a clean, full-scale implementation, which feels right.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am now replacing `/src/components/AboutPage.tsx` with a highly polished, fully custom, and premium implementation. It includes the exact sections requested: a beautiful Hero with custom CTAs, a deep brand story, dedicated spotlight cards for M\303\251lanie and Christelle, a detailed 4-step process timeline showcasing our materials, a gorgeous 6-value bento grid, an-asymmetric picture gallery of the workshop, and a high-converting final CTA directing users to WhatsApp or the Catalogue. I\'ll use `create_file` with `Overwrite: true` to write this clean code."
