        }
        lines {
          text: "        <div className=\"lg:col-span-7 text-left space-y-6\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-pink uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\">Duo de Cr\303\251atrices</span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <h2 className=\"text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-cream\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            L\'origine du R\303\252ve Parfum\303\251"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </h2>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <p className=\"text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed font-light\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            Bienvenue dans le cocon de l\'Atelier. <span className=\"text-brand-pink font-semibold\">R\303\252ve Parfum\303\251 Cr\303\251ation</span> est n\303\251 de la r\303\251union compl\303\251mentaire de nos deux amiti\303\251s et de notre amour sans limite pour le travail manuel. Nous, <span className=\"text-brand-cream font-medium\">M\303\251lanie</span> et <span className=\"text-brand-cream font-medium\">Christelle</span>, partagions l\'ambition d\'insuffler de la po\303\251sie olfactive dans vos int\303\251rieurs de mani\303\250re saine et bienveillante."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <p className=\"text-sm text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed font-light\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            Dans un monde de surconsommation plastique et de parfums industriels de synth\303\250se aux \303\251manations douteuses, nous avons choisi la noblesse : travailler exclusivement la <span className=\"text-brand-pink font-medium\">pure cire v\303\251g\303\251tale de soja 100% naturelle</span> ainsi que de d\303\251licates essences de plantes originaires de <span className=\"text-brand-pink font-medium\">Grasse</span>, certifi\303\251es sans mutag\303\250nes ni phtalates."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div className=\"p-6 bg-brand-depth/60 border border-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl relative\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <h4 className=\"font-serif italic font-bold text-brand-cream text-lg\">\"Chaque parfum est une \303\251motion suspendue...\"</h4>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <p className=\"text-xs text-brand-text-muted font-light mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Qu\'il s\'agisse d\'un petit sachet de fondants en forme de c\305\223ur \303\240 offrir aux invit\303\251s de votre mariage, ou d\'une somptueuse tasse en c\303\251ramique coul\303\251e sous forme de bougie, nous fa\303\247onnons chaque article un par un. Nous esp\303\251rons que nos cr\303\251ations embelliront vos journ\303\251es d\'une douceur bienvenue."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <div className=\"mt-4 flex gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-brand-pink\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span>\342\200\224 M\303\251lanie G.</span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span>\342\200\224 Christelle L.</span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
