    thinking: "**Analyzing /contact Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently breaking down the `/contact` prompt requirements. I\'ve focused on the \"Hero contact\" section and am now examining the `Badge`, `Title`, and `Subtitle` content. It\'s becoming clearer how these elements function together to create the initial user impression. I am refining the required information to make a list.\n\n\n**Defining Contact Features**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the features. There will be quick contact cards, a general form, and practical information cards. The cards will each have an icon, title, description, and WhatsApp button. I\'m carefully considering the required fields for the general form and the best way to categorize inquiries. I\'m focusing on the information necessary to fulfill each user\'s request.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am now overwriting `/src/components/ContactPage.tsx` with a highly premium, fully customized, non-generic contact panel. It implements:\n1. **Atelier Contact Hero** with custom pink/purple background glow, message bubbles, and a direct WhatsApp button.\n2. **5 Precise Quick Contact Cards** (Commander, Personnaliser, \303\211v\303\251nement/Mariage, R\303\251union, Livraison) with an \"\303\211crire\" button launching targeted WhatsApp precompiled messages.\n3. **General Contact Form** inside a beautiful `liquid-strong` card with exact select subjects, inputs, and a warm \"Nous vous r\303\251pondons d\303\250s que possible\" feedback message.\n4. **4 Practical Info Cards** detailing hand-made curation parameters (Preorder wait, Shipping season, Pickup appt, and socials).\n5. **Aesthetic Social Links** (Facebook, Instagram) inside custom blur glass capsules with warm rose states on hover.\n6. **Mini FAQ section** with the exact specified questions answering customer doubts on payments, timelines, and specialized projects.\n\nLet\'s call the `create_file` tool."
