g on layout design. I\'m adding a sticky sidebar for index navigation within the CGV tab or legal pages on desktop. For a superior user experience, I\'m integrating an interactive index switcher within the CGV tab, allowing easy navigation. I\'m also ensuring the CGV comprehensively addresses specific sections: Objet, Produits, Commandes, Prix, Paiement, and Pr\303\251commande with detailed sub-sections.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create the expanded, high-fidelity `LegalPages.tsx` component. It will completely flesh out the **CGV**, **Politique de Confidentialit\303\251**, and **Politique de Livraison & Retrait** sections with highly structured, high-end components. It includes a clickable sticky index for the CGV tab, precise tabular estimated shipping costs, clear warnings of custom creations\' exceptions, and elegant custom-styled layouts."
    thinking_duration {
