          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <div className=\"p-4 bg-brand-pink/5 border border-brand-pink/10 rounded-2xl text-[11px] text-brand-text-muted leading-relaxed font-light text-left flex items-start gap-2.5\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <Heart className=\"w-4 h-4 text-brand-pink shrink-0 mt-0.5\" />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <strong>Dialogue d\'atelier :</strong> Nos ventes se font de gr\303\251 \303\240 gr\303\251 apr\303\250s validation de vos go\303\273ts sur WhatsApp. Les CGV servent \303\240 garantir un cadre s\303\251curisant pour vous et pour nous !"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "              </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "              {/* Main CGV Content Cards */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <div className=\"lg:col-span-8 bg-brand-depth border border-brand-pink/10 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-xl\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalHero "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  title=\"Conditions G\303\251n\303\251rales de Vente\" "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  subtitle=\"Les pr\303\251sentes conditions encadrent les commandes pass\303\251es aupr\303\250s de R\303\252ve Parfum\303\251 Cr\303\251ation.\" "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 1 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-1\" title=\"1. Objet\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Les pr\303\251sentes Conditions G\303\251n\303\251rales de Vente (CGV) encadrent en exclusivit\303\251 la vente de cr\303\251ations parfum\303\251es v\303\251g\303\251tales artisanales et de contenants d\'art en Bourgogne, propos\303\251es sous l\'enseigne commune <strong className=\"text-brand-cream\">R\303\252ve Parfum\303\251 Cr\303\251ation</strong> par Christelle L. et M\303\251lanie G."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Toute passation de projet ou validation de cire suppose l\'acceptation enti\303\250re et sans r\303\251serve des pr\303\251sentes conditions, qui r\303\251gissent au mieux notre relation de confiance de gr\303\251 \303\240 gr\303\251."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 2 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-2\" title=\"2. Produits &amp; Artisanat\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Chacun de nos articles est une \305\223uvre d\'origine humaine faite main. Nous fabriquons des bougies, fondants, bouquets parfum\303\251s, cadres suspendus, suspensions, brumes et poudres, principalement \303\240 base de cire pure de soja saine et de fleurs d\'atelier."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <ul className=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-1 text-[11px] md:text-xs\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>Variations Possibles :</strong> Du fait de notre proc\303\251d\303\251 non automatis\303\251, de l\303\251g\303\250res diff\303\251rences de teintes, d\'\303\251paisseur de gr\303\250s ou d\'agencement floraux botaniques surviennent \303\240 chaque coulage.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>Photos Non-Contractuelles :</strong> Les photos du site sont pr\303\251sent\303\251es de la mani\303\250re la plus digne mais ne garantissent pas un aspect identique \303\240 100 %.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>Personnalisations :</strong> Elles sont soumises \303\240 la faisabilit\303\251 technique et aux stocks de mati\303\250res botaniques de saison.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </ul>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 3 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-3\" title=\"3. Commandes\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Conform\303\251ment au positionnement humain de l\'atelier, la validation s\'effectue par messagerie instantan\303\251e (WhatsApp) ou par formulaire de contact d\'\303\251criture :"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <ul className=\"list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1 mt-1 text-[11px] md:text-xs\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>Prise de contact de l\'acheteur avec formulation de ses envies sp\303\251cifiques.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>\303\211change direct sur les essences parfum\303\251es de Grasse adapt\303\251es \303\240 son projet d\'int\303\251rieur.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>D\303\251livrance d\'un r\303\251capitulatif d\303\251taill\303\251 d\'atelier valider d\'un commun accord.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>La commande est consid\303\251r\303\251e ferme d\303\250s accord mutuel et validation du montant d\'attention, avec mise en production du coulage.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </ul>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 4 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-4\" title=\"4. Tarifs &amp; Prix\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Les prix de nos cr\303\251ations de cire saine et suspensions sont exprim\303\251s en Euros (\342\202\254) et sont nets. TVA non applicable, en vertu de l\342\200\231article 293 B du Code G\303\251n\303\251ral des Imp\303\264ts (r\303\251gime micro-entreprises)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Les frais de livraison et d\'emballage postal amortis sont factur\303\251s en suppl\303\251ment \303\240 prix co\303\273tant selon le mode d\'exp\303\251dition (Colissimo, Mondial Relay) convenu. Les devis \303\251v\303\251nements (mariages, comm\303\251morations) proposent des tarifs d\303\251gressifs selon les volumes."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 5 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-5\" title=\"5. Modalit\303\251s de Paiement\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Le r\303\250glement de vos cr\303\251ations s\'effectue \303\240 l\'aide des passerelles d\303\251sign\303\251es lors de l\'\303\251change amiable :"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <ul className=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-1\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>PayPal :</strong> Transfert s\303\251curis\303\251 de fonds entre particuliers ou professionnels.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>Wero / Paylib / Virement imm\303\251diat :</strong> Solution directe sans frais pour nos clients.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </ul>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <LegalNoticeBox type=\"warning\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <strong>R\303\250gle d\'Atelier :</strong> <code>[Pr\303\251ciser acompte ou paiement total avant fabrication]</code>. Par d\303\251faut, pour les s\303\251ries de f\303\252tes ou cadeaux personnalis\303\251s d\'invit\303\251s, un paiement complet ou d\'acompte de 50% est requis avant l\'incorporation des huiles de Grasse et le coulage d\303\251coratif des cires de soja."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </LegalNoticeBox>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 6 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-6\" title=\"6. Pr\303\251commande &amp; D\303\251lais\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Afin d\'offrir la plus saine et fra\303\256che des exp\303\251riences d\'effluves, nous ne conservons pas d\'important stock industriel. Les produits sont fabriqu\303\251s ou pr\303\251par\303\251s sur commande."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Le d\303\251lai moyen d\'ex\303\251cution d\342\200\231environ deux semaines est \303\240 pr\303\251voir pour le s\303\251chage lent. Lors des f\303\252tes de fin d\'ann\303\251e ou des c\303\251r\303\251monies rituelles d\'\303\251t\303\251, ce sillage de fabrication artisanale peut \303\252tre prolong\303\251."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 7 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-7\" title=\"7. Livraison &amp; Retrait physique\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Les exp\303\251ditions se coordonnent avec grand soin. Nos conditions logistiques pr\303\251cisent :"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <ul className=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-[11px] md:text-xs\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>P\303\251riode Postale :</strong> Les colis d\'envois ne circulent que de d\'<strong>octobre \303\240 mars</strong> pour prot\303\251ger la cire naturelle \303\240 basse fusion des fortes temp\303\251ratures estivales.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li><strong>Retrait sur Rendez-vous :</strong> Durant les p\303\251riodes chaudes d\'avril \303\240 septembre (ou toute l\'ann\303\251e pour les voisins), le retrait direct et gracieux \303\240 l\'atelier bourguignon est vivement recommand\303\251.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </ul>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 8 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-8\" title=\"8. Droit de r\303\251tractation\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    Conform\303\251ment aux directives de l\'article L221-18 du Code de la consommation, l\'acheteur dispose d\'un droit de 14 jours pour retourner une cr\303\251ation ordinaire, \303\240 ses frais exclusifs, dans son \303\251tat de scell\303\251 originel de cire."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <LegalNoticeBox type=\"warning\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <strong>Exception l\303\251gale importante :</strong> Les produits personnalis\303\251s ou fabriqu\303\251s selon les sp\303\251cifications claires du client (\303\251tiquettes d\'\303\251v\303\251nement, inscriptions grav\303\251es, m\303\251langes exclusifs de fleurs) sont exclus de tout droit de r\303\251tractation et d\'\303\251change, sauf anomalie due \303\240 l\'atelier. Cette section est fournie sous r\303\251serve de validation juridique r\303\251ciproque."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </LegalNoticeBox>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                </LegalSection>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                {/* Section 9 */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <LegalSection id=\"cgv-9\" title=\"9. Produits endommag\303\251s\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    \303\200 la r\303\251ception, si votre contenant en c\303\251ramique d\'art ou votre cadre de cire solide a subi des heurts postaux :"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  <ul className=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>Prendre des photos nettes et imm\303\251diates du colis ouvert ainsi que des d\303\251gradations de la pi\303\250ce.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <li>Nous transmettre le dossier sous 48h sur WhatsApp.</li>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
